  "prefLabel": "He-A 706.04 Access for Inspection and Monitoring",
  "priorExpiration": "2006-11-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 706.04 Access for Inspection and Monitoring. As a condition of approval, each IDIP or WIDIP provider shall:\n\n(a) Provide access at any time during its hours of operation to department representatives for purposes of inspection and monitoring; and\n\n(b) Cooperate fully with and answer all questions of department representatives regarding the provision of IDIP or WIDIP services to the public.\n\nSource. #6653, EMERGENCY, eff 12-12-97, EXPIRED 4-11-98\n\nNew. #6753, eff 5-20-98; ss by #8624, INTERIM, eff 5-20-06, EXPIRES: 11-16-06; ss by #8749, eff 11-16-06",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-a700.html"
